  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Tibidee</defName>
    <label>tibidee</label>
    <description>Tibidees were giant silicon-based creature native to Stygeon Prime, though they could also be found on other mountainous Outer Rim planets (such as Oosalon). Though normally gentle, tibidees would attack anything they felt was threatening.</description>
